they built a new putt-putt course.

15
00:00:41,162 --> 00:00:42,702
SHELDON:
This is great.

16
00:00:42,872 --> 00:00:45,712
(Sheldon:)Look at me.
I'm in the real world of ordinary people...

17
00:00:45,875 --> 00:00:49,625
